                                                    <div style="color: var(--accent); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 3px;">ðŸ’¡ GUÃA PARA IA (MIDJOURNEY/DALL-E)</div>
                                                    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;">
